\n:albumTrackCount a owl:FunctionalProperty .\\n\\n### Restrictions and Axioms\\n# Album must have at least one track\\n:Album rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :albumHasTrack ; owl:minQualifiedCardinality \\\"1\\\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; owl:onClass :Track ] .\\n:Album rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :albumTrackCount ; owl:minQualifiedCardinality \\\"1\\\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ] .\\n\\n# Disjointness axioms\\n:Person owl:disjointWith :Band .\\n:Instrument owl:disjointWith :Role .\\n:Album owl:disjointWith :Song .\\n:Track owl:disjointWith :Song .\\n:Critic owl:disjointWith :Performance .\\n:Performance owl:disjointWith :Album .\\n:City owl:disjointWith :Region .\\n:Region owl:disjointWith :Country .\\n\"}",
